677?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c854ed58b8caf094499a6c71c1540bc5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6a6bf802/uploads/origins/1fa8d051-11e7-4845-bdf7-808bfaff3677?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c854ed58b8caf094499a6c71c1540bc5, https://si.imgix.net/6a6bf802/uploads/origins/1fa8d051-11e7-4845-bdf7-808bfaff3677?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9c808e15b6495f21615c21c487a2dc44 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6a6bf802/uploads/origins/1fa8d051-11e7-4845-bdf7-808bfaff3677?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3fc816c9fd1b77b86c67fd1f235ad094 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I have another idea to share with you. It is about the mermaid or the Matsya-kanya or jalpari. It's literal meaning is fish maiden while jalpari means water fairy. They are the described as the daughters of the god of ocean Varuna. Varuna's mount happens to also be a makara. Varuna's wife Varuni is the goddess of intoxication. She is represented for all alcoholic beverages. My idea for the Matsya-kanyas is that they can come in many different forms as well just like Matsya or the depictions of the makara. \n\nI had an idea for a story where a lone orphan fisherman happens to catch one. Let's call him Neel, which means blue. The Matsya-kanya would have golden scales and jewelry. Her eyes are as shiny as gemstones. She also looks kind of like a sahuagin. She offers soma, which is a special drink of the divine to if let go, to which Neel agrees. He starts to drink it when he is done working for the day. A bit later he gets a visit from a bedazzling beauty offering her body. Because the soma is a divine drink, he was actually heavily intoxicated and started hallucinating. The beauty is actually the matsya-kanya from earlier who was spying on him after being let go and was smitten with him for his kindness. The feel of her webbed hands and mouth was unlike anything Neel felt before. Neel would give it his all into a mating press and his instincts tell him to release everything inside before the soma starts to affect him and he passes out. The matsya-kanya hugs him close before leaving. The lone Neel wakes up in the morning feeling like he isn't alone anymore after that incident. He feels something like a guardian watching over him now. As it turns out it is his new family watching over him.\n\nWhat do you think of this story? I hope you like it!", "nc": 33, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Wy6OHHVOYS/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 4086462, "client_id": 727547, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/029d831b/uploads/origins/113eb805-61a8-4393-a691-f267c4f3e5a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=657d9d6f9868eea6aef82c0347d97997", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/029d831b/uploads/origins/113eb805-61a8-4393-a691-f267c4f3e5a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=657d9d6f9868eea6aef82c0347d97997, https://si.imgix.net/029d831b/uploads/origins/113eb805-61a8-4393-a691-f267c4f3e5a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ff3b0fdbceebe1c7058f58b9d508cc1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/029d831b/uploads/origins/113eb805-61a8-4393-a691-f267c4f3e5a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7afa93fefe64dbad929995a92dfa83a1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/029d831b/uploads/origins/113eb805-61a8-4393-a691-f267c4f3e5a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6030a80939a826b779b2edf18e6d8b78", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/029d831b/uploads/origins/113eb805-61a8-4393-a691-f267c4f3e5a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6030a80939a826b779b2edf18e6d8b78, https://si.imgix.net/029d831b/uploads/origins/113eb805-61a8-4393-a691-f267c4f3e5a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9403a7934c093d83af01f9b61e0a9070 2x, https://si.imgix.net/029d831b/uploads/origins/113eb805-61a8-4393-a691-f267c4f3e5a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b76ada0a556c0048c06c11187559817a 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I was wondering if you could do something like a cover page and glossary for the Makara and the Bride pictures. I am thinking of giving the bride the name of Padma, which means lotus. I was thinking that the cover would have Padma look like she is meditating underwater, and the makara is swimming overhead or around her as her protector. The specific hand sign I have as reference is the Yoni Mudra which symbolizes the womb. \n\nAs for the glossary, let's say Padma met the Makara as she was bathing in it's domain. She had not felt love for any man but was pleasantly surprised her feelings sprung up for the makara. She thought it was taboo at first but being as the makara showed itself to her and was able to bear it's children, those thoughts went away. The makara itself has an ability turns the water it is in currently to be more of an aphrodisiac, but Padma doesn't know. If she is happy though, would it matter?\n\nWhat do you think? Are you able to do a cover in color? I'm just curious how they would look more fleshed out like your other stories. Hope you like this idea too!\n\nhttps://share.google/LfQgajWt5AYmxQ0E8", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Wy6OHHVOYS/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f9e832fb/uploads/origins/1314587f-da91-40fd-8a3e-de4010c55035?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fi